COMPILATION OF: E52WK

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52WK

   1 a 0000 E52WK: procedure options(main);
   2 a 0006 
   3 a 0006    /* E52WK probe (PLAN sec P3-10 panel G): the exact
   4 a 0006       LOAN2 91-92 shape, OR condition + SIGNAL in the THEN
   5 a 0006       body. E52VB measured the 17-byte fold 2A r(dl) /
   6 a 0006       2B 2B 2B / 7C / 2F / F5 / 3A r(dl+1) / C1 / B0 / F2
   7 a 0006       slot (C367). LOAN2: JP patches to the statement
   8 a 0006       AFTER the 7-byte signal (0356 F2 -> 0360). Predict
   9 a 0006       H-G: fold bytes verbatim from the VB golden, signal
  10 a 0006       region 21 00 00 / AF / CD ?SIGOP, F2 target = the
  11 a 0006       x = 2 continuation immediately after the 7 bytes. */
  12 a 0006 
  13 c 0006    dcl dl fixed binary;
  14 c 0006    dcl x fixed bin;
  15 c 0006 
  16 c 0006    if dl < 0 | dl > 2 then
  17 c 0017       signal error;
  18 c 001E    x = 2;
  19 c 0024 
  20 a 0024 end E52WK;

CODE SIZE = 0027
DATA AREA = 0004
FREE SYMS = 38BA
END  COMPILATION
